# Spotify User Churn Prediction

## 🚀 Project Overview

This project aims to predict customer churn for a subscription-based service like Spotify. By analyzing user behavior and demographic data, we build and evaluate several machine learning models to identify customers who are likely to cancel their subscriptions. Proactively identifying these users allows a business to take targeted actions (e.g., special offers, new content recommendations) to retain them.

This repository contains the Jupyter Notebook with the complete end-to-end workflow, from data exploration to model evaluation.

